{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/3620","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/3620/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/3620/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/3620/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/3620","id":32740137,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMjc0MDEzNw==","number":3620,"title":"Domain should added separately for SMB mount(Not in username)","user":{"login":"spoon99","id":631101,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTEwMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/631101?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99","html_url":"https://github.com/spoon99","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spoon99/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":25816,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTgxNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e11d21","default":true,"description":null},{"id":139179813,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzkxNzk4MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/labels/synced-folders/general","name":"synced-folders/general","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":null},{"id":218284952,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTgyODQ5NTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/labels/synced-folders/smb","name":"synced-folders/smb","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2014-05-03T05:07:12Z","updated_at":"2020-04-08T02:05:56Z","closed_at":"2015-06-01T03:19:08Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm running hyper-v on windows8.1 pro. I have problem with /vargrant folder mount using SMB.\n\nOn command prompt it says\n\n``` Batchfile\nFailed to mount folders in Linux guest. This is usually because\nthe \"vboxsf\" file system is not available. Please verify that\nthe guest additions are properly installed in the guest and\ncan work properly. The command attempted was:\n\nmount -t cifs -o uid=`id -u vagrant`,gid=`getent group vagrant | cut -d: -f3`,sec=ntlm,username=babple/spoon,pass='PASSWORDHIDDEN' //192.168.1.177/184481a2ad253a5c80798308496d1eda /vagrant\n\nmount -t cifs -o uid=`id -u vagrant`,gid=`id -g vagrant`,sec=ntlm,username=babple/spoon,pass='PASSWORDHIDDEN' //192.168.1.177/184481a2ad253a5c80798308496d1eda /vagrant\n```\n\nSo I tried those commands on ssh, but it fails with Permmision denied.\nHowever when I tried below comman it success.\n\n``` bash\nsudo mount -t cifs -o uid=`id -u vagrant`,gid=`getent group vagrant | cut -d: -f3`,sec=ntlm,username=spoon,pass='MYPASSWORD',domain=babple //192.168.1.177/184481a2ad253a5c80798308496d1eda /vagrant\n```\n\nI think domain parameter should use separately for domain not in username.\n","closed_by":{"login":"sethvargo","id":408570,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwODU3MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/408570?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethvargo","html_url":"https://github.com/sethvargo","followers